# The source the per-flavour tocs are generated from -- one today,
# Manners_Camelot.toc -- and the fallback the game reads on any client that does
# not honour a suffixed name. Edit this one; run `python tools/maketocs.py` and
# the generated toc follows. tests/validate.py fails if they have drifted.
#
# The interface is a single number, 16001, because 1.0 ships for WoW Forever
# alone. It is the one client anybody here can test, and the number is the one
# that shipped and is known to work there.
## Interface: 16001
## Title: Manners
